# Every address and constant the fork-demo scripts use (docs/analysis/FORK-PRESENTATION.md). Public data only: the
# RPC key stays in keys.ini. Read on-chain on 2026-10-11 at block 26165572; re-check at a new fork block (step 1 of
# FORK-PRESENTATION.md §8) and change them here only.

# --- fork
FORK_RPC=http://127.0.0.1:8545
# keyless upstreams that serve old state (an archive answer at head - 5,000 on 2026-10-11); dRPC is left out on purpose:
# it is the cross-check's independent node (crosscheck.SECOND_RPCS)
FORK_UPSTREAMS="https://mainnet.gateway.tenderly.co https://eth-mainnet.public.blastapi.io https://rpc.mevblocker.io"

